    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "GVM are delighted to present this exceptional detached four-bedroom residence, ideally positioned in a peaceful countryside setting just two minutes from Pallaskenry Village and approximately 20 minutes from Limerick City.\n\nOffering an impressive combination of space, privacy and convenience, this substantial family home extends to approximately 4,500 sq. ft. and occupies a beautifully landscaped site. The property provides an enviable rural lifestyle while remaining within easy reach of the village and a comprehensive range of local amenities.\n\nInternally, the accommodation is exceptionally well proportioned and thoughtfully laid out, with bright, spacious rooms throughout. The ground floor comprises an impressive grand entrance hall, spacious sitting room, family room, kitchen/dining area, two ensuite bedrooms, utility room, laundry room, storeroom and guest WC.\n\nUpstairs, there are two further generously sized bedrooms, both enjoying ensuite facilities. The luxurious master bedroom ensuite features a jacuzzi bath, while a stylish family bathroom completes the first-floor accommodation.\n\nThe overall layout provides excellent flexibility for modern family living, with generous reception areas, four ensuite bedrooms and an abundance of storage and ancillary space.\n\nA particular feature of the property is the excellent selection of outdoor facilities, including a purpose-built workshop and three large dog kennels, making this an ideal home for those seeking generous space both inside and out.\n\nSet in a tranquil and attractive countryside location yet just moments from Pallaskenry and within convenient commuting distance of Limerick City, this outstanding residence represents a rare opportunity to acquire a substantial, high-quality family home in a superb setting.\n\nEarly viewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate the exceptional space, quality and lifestyle this property has to offer.\n\nFor further information or to arrange a viewing, please contact Richard Ryan on 063 98555 or 087 8067772.\n\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall - 24'6\" (7.47m) x 16'0\" (4.88m)\nWith solid wooden floor, vaulted ceiling.\n\nSittingroom - 17'8\" (5.38m) x 17'8\" (5.38m)\nWith solid wooden floor, cast iron fireplace with marble surround (gas fire). Ornate coving on ceiling.\n\nFamily Room - 18'8\" (5.69m) x 17'6\" (5.33m)\nWith solid wooden floor, feature marble fireplace (gas fire). Vaulted ceiling and French doors leading to rear patio area.\n\nKitchen/Dining Room - 36'0\" (10.97m) x 14'6\" (4.42m)\nWith tiled floor, fitted units integrated appliances, quartz counter top, gas stove and tiled flooring. Island with stainless steel sink. French patio doors leading to rear patio area.\n\nUtility Room - 10'4\" (3.15m) x 10'4\" (3.15m)\nWith tiled floor and splash back, fitted units, stainless steel sink & plumbed for dish washer.\n\nGuest Toilet\nWith toilet & wash hand basin, half tiled.\n\nStore-room - 16'0\" (4.88m) x 9'4\" (2.84m)\nL shaped.\n\nLaundry-room - 11'3\" (3.43m) x 7'0\" (2.13m)\nPlumbed for washing machine & dryer.\n\nBedroom No 1 - 14'7\" (4.45m) x 11'6\" (3.51m)\nWith semi-solid wooden floor.\n\nWalk in wardrobe - 8'2\" (2.49m) x 5'4\" (1.63m)\n\nEnsuite - 6'0\" (1.83m) x 5'9\" (1.75m)\nFully tiled with toilet, wash hand basin & shower cubicle.\n\nBedroom No 2 - 17'9\" (5.41m) x 16'5\" (5m)\nWith semi-solid wooden floor & ornate coving.\n\nWalk in wardrobe - 7'2\" (2.18m) x 5'9\" (1.75m)\n\nEnsuite - 5'9\" (1.75m) x 5'8\" (1.73m)\nFully tiled with toilet, wash hand basin & shower cubicle.\n\nLarge Landing\n\nMaster Bedroom - 22'4\" (6.81m) x 17'9\" (5.41m)\nWith semi-solid wooden floor\n\nEnsuite Bathroom - 18'8\" (5.69m) x 11'6\" (3.51m)\nFully tiled floor, with double shower cubicle, free standing jacuzzi bath, vanity unit with double sinks and toilet.\n\nWalk in wardrobe - 30'8\" (9.35m) x 7'8\" (2.34m)\n\nBedroom No 4 - 22'9\" (6.93m) x 17'9\" (5.41m)\nWith semi-solid wooden floor.\n\nEnsuite - 6'3\" (1.91m) x 8'6\" (2.59m)\nFully tiled with toilet, wash hand basin & shower cubicle.\n\nWalk in wardrobe - 11'0\" (3.35m) x 8'8\" (2.64m)\n\nWalk in hotpress\n\nMain Bathroom - 12'9\" (3.89m) x 10'3\" (3.12m)\nFully tiled, traditional style free standing bath, shower cubicle, toilet and wash hand basin.\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
